  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gyadi Gyadin Arewa Women Rice Production and Processing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant for GAWFMCS, a local womens farming cooperative, will address identified constraints by developing its business management, financial management, and technical capacities. GAWFMCS will establish a processing house with modern rice processing machines and will undergo a series of trainings aimed at developing the cooperative&apos;s management capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
